      "formation": "Noun A や noun B + the particle required by the rest of the sentence.",
      "notes": [
        "や connects nouns, not full clauses or conjugated verbs. Use たり for sample activities.",
        "と can suggest a complete list; や leaves other members unmentioned."
      ],
